# Animations

## Animation

What to test:

- Cycle through Randomise, Remove Data, Add/Remove Series and Switch Direction; bars animate smoothly between states.
- Toggle stacked/grouped and move the legend; layout reflows without jumps.
- Switch standalone/integrated mode; category ordering is preserved.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Animation Example" name="animation" type="generated" /%}

## Animation (Grouped Category Axis)

What to test:

- Run Randomise, Remove Data and Add/Remove Series; grouped category labels stay aligned with their bars.
- Switch stacked/grouped and direction; the group hierarchy remains intact.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Animation Example (Grouped Category Axis)" name="animation-grouped-category" type="generated" /%}

## Vertical Animation

What to test:

- Use Randomise, Remove and Reset; vertical bars animate height changes without flicker.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Vertical Animation Example" name="animation-vertical" type="generated" /%}
